.TH TDEPACKAGEKIT-NOTIFIER 1 "2026-11-05" "tdepackagekit 0.0.3" "Trinity Desktop Environment"
.SH NAME
tdepackagekit\-notifier \- tray icon that shows when software updates are available
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tdepackagekit\-notifier
.RI [ "Trinity and TQt options" ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tdepackagekit\-notifier
puts an icon in the Trinity system tray and tells you when software updates
are available. It asks PackageKit for fresh package information at the chosen
interval, and shows a message when there are new updates. The icon turns into
a warning when some of them fix security problems.
.PP
It only notifies.
.B It never installs anything by itself.
.PP
Clicking the icon opens the Updates page of
.BR tdepackagekit (1).
Its context menu can check now, open the settings, or quit until the next
login.
.PP
It starts at login from
.IR /opt/trinity/share/autostart/tdepackagekit\-notifier.desktop ,
unless it is turned off in the settings. It waits a little after login before
its first check. Only one copy runs at a time.
.SH SETTINGS
The settings are changed in
.BR "tdepackagekit \-\-settings" ,
and stored in the
.B [Notifier]
group of
.IR ~/.trinity/share/config/tdepackagekitrc :
.TP
.BR Enabled " (default " true )
Run the notifier. When false it exits, and isn't started at login.
.TP
.BR HideWhenIdle " (default " false )
Hide the tray icon while there are no updates to show.
.TP
.BR CheckIntervalHours " (default " 24 )
Hours between automatic refreshes of the package information.
.B 0
means never refresh; updates downloaded by other tools are still noticed.
.TP
.BR NotifySecurityOnly " (default " false )
Only notify about security updates.
.TP
.BR InitialDelaySeconds " (default " 120 )
Seconds to wait after starting before the first check.
.SH DCOP INTERFACE
The notifier registers as
.B tdepackagekit\-notifier
with an object called
.BR notifier :
.TP
.B dcop tdepackagekit\-notifier notifier checkNow
Refresh the package information and check for updates now.
.TP
.B dcop tdepackagekit\-notifier notifier reloadSettings
Read the settings again.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tdepackagekit (1),
.BR dcop (1)
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at https://github.com/Yjlion/tde-packagekit/issues.
